# Local development secrets for the standalone admin Worker.
# Copy this file to admin/.dev.vars (which is git-ignored).
#
# Admin accounts sign in with a username and password stored in the admin_users
# table. Create the first account from the dashboard setup screen or from the CLI
# (`npm run admin -- create-admin <username> <password>`). The first account is a
# super admin; later admins cannot read the audit log.
#
# No secrets are required for local development.
#
# Optional Turnstile configuration. The login widget and the server-side check are
# skipped while either value is empty, so leave both blank for normal local work.
# TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=0x4AAAAAAA...
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=0x4AAAAAAA...
